description = Color([PAWN_nameDef] was captured and put on death row for war crimes.\n\nFortunately for [PAWN_objective], someone cut the power to [PAWN_possessive] cell block. Riots ignited. Guards and trained wargs were deployed to quell the uprising. Organizing a few other inmates, [PAWN_nameDef] escaped in a small spacecraft., 1.0)
